    "detailed_description": "Get ready for an epic showdown in Trapped out! - the ultimate family-friendly action party game where chaos, fun, and laughter collide in a 3D battle arena! Engage in thrilling combat against friends and foes, both locally and online, as you strive to rack up points and emerge victorious.<br><br><strong>Key Features:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Crazy Weapons and Wild Effects:</strong> Unleash the madness with an arsenal of wacky weapons! Slap your opponents silly with a giant hand, smash them with a door, or surprise them with a range of hilarious effects that will keep everyone on their toes.<br><br></li><li><strong>Local and Online Multiplayer:</strong> Whether you're hosting a game night at home or challenging players from around the globe, Trapped out offers seamless local and online multiplayer action.  go head-to-head in epic battles!<br><br></li><li><strong>Unlockable Costumes:</strong> Express your unique style with a plethora of fun and crazy costumes. Unlock a wide variety of outfits to customize your character and stand out in the arena!<br><br></li><li><strong>Family-Friendly Fun:</strong> With its colorful graphics and lighthearted gameplay, Trapped out is perfect for players of all ages. Gather your family and friends for an unforgettable brawling experience.<br><br></li><li><strong>Dynamic 3D Arenas:</strong> Fight in vibrant and interactive 3D arenas that add an extra layer of excitement to each battle. Navigate Traps, find strategic advantages, and make every fight a memorable one.</li></ul><br><strong>Join the Battle:</strong><br><br>Dive into Trapped out and discover a world where every fight is an opportunity for outrageous fun and endless laughter. Are you ready to brawl your way to the top?<br><br>Add Trapped out to your wishlist now and prepare a whole lot of fun!",
